3ch2 style=\&quot;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;color:#4a2b4f;font-size:26px;margin:36px 0 12px;\&quot;\u003eFor nerves that need more than one kind of help\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp style=\&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#332433;margin:0 0 14px;\&quot;\u003eThe cream works where it burns. The capsules work where it starts. The glycinate works while you sleep. Outside, inside, and overnight. One routine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:14px;\&quot;\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\&quot;flex:1 1 200px;background:#f3eaf6;color:#332433;border-radius:12px;padding:20px 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;\&quot;\u003e🧼\u003ch3 style=\&quot;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:19px;margin:8px 0 8px;color:#332433;\&quot;\u003eOutside: the jar\u003c\/h3\u003eThe original Mama Bear Nerve Relief Lotion. Topical magnesium worked into feet and legs, right where the burning and tingling live.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\&quot;flex:1 1 200px;background:#efe7f3;color:#332433;border-radius:12px;padding:20px 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;\&quot;\u003e💊\u003ch3 style=\&quot;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:19px;margin:8px 0 8px;color:#332433;\&quot;\u003eInside: alpha lipoic acid\u003c\/h3\u003eALA 600mg, one of the most studied nutrients for nerve health support, taken daily. Quiet, steady, from within.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\&quot;flex:1 1 200px;background:#38203c;color:#f3eaf6;border-radius:12px;padding:20px 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;\&quot;\u003e🌙\u003ch3 style=\&quot;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:19px;margin:8px 0 8px;color:#f3eaf6;\&quot;\u003eOvernight: magnesium glycinate\u003c\/h3\u003eThe gentle form of magnesium, taken in the evening to support calm, restful sleep. Because the whole point is getting your nights back.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch2 style=\&quot;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;color:#4a2b4f;font-size:26px;margin:36px 0 12px;\&quot;\u003eWhy pills alone weren’t enough. Why creams alone weren’t either.\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp style=\&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#332433;margin:0 0 14px;\&quot;\u003eIf you’ve been at this a while, you’ve probably tried both, separately, and been disappointed twice. The cream soothed but didn’t reach deep enough. The supplement was invisible day to day.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#332433;margin:0 0 14px;\&quot;\u003eThey were never supposed to compete. They’re pieces of one routine. And the piece most people forget is the night itself.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\&quot;background:#2e2230;color:#f0e8f3;border-radius:12px;padding:22px 24px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:24px;\&quot;\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThe honest part.\u003c\/strong\u003e Nothing in this bundle cures nerve damage, and we won’t pretend otherwise. This is daily support and daily comfort. Some feel it fast. Some build to it. Some don’t, and use the guarantee.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch2 style=\&quot;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;color:#4a2b4f;font-size:26px;margin:36px 0 12px;\&quot;\u003eWhat’s in the bundle\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul style=\&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#332433;padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 10px;\&quot;\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 jar of Mama Bear Nerve Relief Lotion (4 oz)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 bottle of Alpha Lipoic Acid 600mg, 30 capsules\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 bottle of Magnesium Glycinate, 120 capsules\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 style=\&quot;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;color:#4a2b4f;font-size:26px;margin:36px 0 12px;\&quot;\u003eFrom people who use more than one\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\&quot;border:1px solid #e6dcec;border-left:5px solid #4a2b4f;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 18px;margin:12px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#332433;\&quot;\u003e“Best product on the market for neuropathy that I have found, from the Oasis cream to the roll on to the capsules. I appreciate this product more than most.”\u003cdiv style=\&quot;color:#b98d4f;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;margin-top:6px;\&quot;\u003e★★★★★ Carrol Marshall\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\&quot;border:1px solid #e6dcec;border-left:5px solid #4a2b4f;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 18px;margin:12px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#332433;\&quot;\u003e“I’ve been using the nerve relief lotion for over a month and I definitely can say it provides relief. I’ve had debilitating neuropathy for over a year. Mama Bear has helped provide some great relief.”\u003cdiv style=\&quot;color:#b98d4f;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;margin-top:6px;\&quot;\u003e★★★★★ Robyn Carswell\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\&quot;border:1px solid #e6dcec;border-left:5px solid #4a2b4f;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 18px;margin:12px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#332433;\&quot;\u003e“Using the mama bear roll on to my lower back and the lotion to my feet and legs, did wonders. In a matter of a couple of days I felt a big difference.”\u003cdiv style=\&quot;color:#b98d4f;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;margin-top:6px;\&quot;\u003e★★★★★ Marybeth Dunkelberger\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch2 style=\&quot;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;color:#4a2b4f;font-size:26px;margin:36px 0 12px;\&quot;\u003eAsked and answered\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\&quot;border-top:1px solid #e6dcec;padding:14px 0;\&quot;\u003e\n\u003cstrong style=\&quot;display:block;color:#4a2b4f;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:4px;\&quot;\u003eHow do I take them together?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cp style=\&quot;margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#332433;\&quot;\u003eCream on feet and legs at bedtime. One ALA capsule daily with food. Magnesium glycinate in the evening. Two minutes total.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\&quot;border-top:1px solid #e6dcec;padding:14px 0;\&quot;\u003e\n\u003cstrong style=\&quot;display:block;color:#4a2b4f;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:4px;\&quot;\u003eWhen will I feel something?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cp style=\&quot;margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#332433;\&quot;\u003eThe cream: many feel soothing in the first nights. The glycinate: calmer evenings tend to come early. The ALA works quietly over weeks. The 90-day guarantee covers the whole experiment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\&quot;border-top:1px solid #e6dcec;padding:14px 0;\&quot;\u003e\n\u003cstrong style=\&quot;display:block;color:#4a2b4f;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:4px;\&quot;\u003eCan I take ALA with my medications?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cp style=\&quot;margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#332433;\&quot;\u003eAsk your doctor or pharmacist, especially if you manage blood sugar. We’d rather you check than guess.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\&quot;background:#f3eaf6;border-radius:12px;padding:26px;text-align:center;margin-top:36px;\&quot;\u003e\n\u003ch2 style=\&quot;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;color:#4a2b4f;font-size:26px;margin:0 0 10px;\&quot;\u003e90 days. Money back.\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp style=\&quot;margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#332433;\&quot;\u003eNo jar counting, no arguments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e&quot;}" selectedvariant="{&quot;id&quot;:52811462246631,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;30-Day Bundle&quot;,&quot;option1&quot;:&quot;30-Day Bundle&quot;,&quot;option2&quot;:null,&quot;option3&quot;:null,&quot;sku&quot;:&quot;NC001&quot;,&quot;requires_shipping&quot;:true,&quot;taxable&quot;:true,&quot;featured_image&quot;:null,&quot;available&quot;:true,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;The Nerve Bundle - 30-Day Bundle&quot;,&quot;public_title&quot;:&quot;30-Day Bundle&quot;,&quot;options&quot;:[&quot;30-Day Bundle&quot;],&quot;price&quot;:48800,&quo